# Allow-list: ignore everything, then add back only what the image needs.
# This way new files (exports, databases, secrets) can never slip into the
# build context by accident.
*
!requirements.txt
!chat_vault/

# Belt and braces: even inside allowed paths, never send these.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/conversations.json
**/*.zip
data/
